  },
  {
   "start_ms": 539720,
   "end_ms": 542720,
   "text": "I'm just trying to watch the dishes right now, man"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 542720,
   "end_ms": 545720,
   "text": "That wasn't like that every day"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 545720,
   "end_ms": 547720,
   "text": "But there was one girl who was really aggressive"
