   "start_ms": 738720,
   "end_ms": 740720,
   "text": "I guess"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 740720,
   "end_ms": 743720,
   "text": "They don't make new versions of the cool phones"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 743720,
   "end_ms": 746720,
   "text": "That slide open or spin anymore, do they?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 746720,
   "end_ms": 748720,
   "text": "It's innovation"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 748720,
   "end_ms": 750720,
   "text": "Everything is touchscreens"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 750720,
   "end_ms": 752720,
   "text": "A lot happens in 17 years"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 752720,
   "end_ms": 756720,
   "text": "You know, I did some technical innovations of my own in the other world"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 756720,
   "end_ms": 758720,
   "text": "Oh yeah?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 758720,
   "end_ms": 761720,
   "text": "I met a pot that overflowed with water"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 761720,
   "end_ms": 763720,
   "text": "To stop a village just dropped"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 763720,
   "end_ms": 765720,
   "text": "Whoa, how?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 765720,
   "end_ms": 767720,
   "text": "I used two spells"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 767720,
   "end_ms": 770720,
   "text": "It'll just be easier to show you how I did it"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 770720,
   "end_ms": 772720,
   "text": "Diggers, Elron"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 776720,
   "end_ms": 778720,
   "text": "Whoa"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 778720,
   "end_ms": 781720,
   "text": "Is this one of your memories?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 781720,
   "end_ms": 785720,
   "text": "There are these spell cards charged with magic"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 785720,
   "end_ms": 792720,
   "text": "With a lot of work, I managed to reverse the electrolysis process to create water"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 792720,
   "end_ms": 794720,
   "text": "You beat modern science?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 794720,
   "end_ms": 796720,
   "text": "Wow, you must have blown other minds"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 796720,
   "end_ms": 800720,
   "text": "I mean, I bet all those villagers were cheering your name"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 800720,
   "end_ms": 802720,
   "text": "No"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 806720,
   "end_ms": 808720,
   "text": "They tried to hang me"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 810720,
   "end_ms": 813720,
   "text": "They destroyed the pot"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 815720,
   "end_ms": 819720,
   "text": "I guess what I did was sacrilegious"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 819720,
   "end_ms": 821720,
   "text": "Stop"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 821720,
   "end_ms": 824720,
   "text": "Someone rescued you"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 824720,
   "end_ms": 826720,
   "text": "Who's that awful woman?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 826720,
   "end_ms": 828720,
   "text": "What? That's her?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 828720,
   "end_ms": 830720,
   "text": "Yes, I know he has an evil face"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 830720,
   "end_ms": 832720,
   "text": "It's like an orc"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 832720,
   "end_ms": 834720,
   "text": "I don't understand why you wouldn't trust him"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 834720,
   "end_ms": 836720,
   "text": "I promise"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 840720,
   "end_ms": 842720,
   "text": "Get grace"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 842720,
   "end_ms": 844720,
   "text": "Yeah, that's pretty much it"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 849720,
   "end_ms": 851720,
   "text": "I get it"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 851720,
   "end_ms": 854720,
   "text": "First person view is hard to follow"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 854720,
   "end_ms": 856720,
   "text": "Hey, what's that?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 856720,
   "end_ms": 860720,
   "text": "I can swipe here to rotate the camera around"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 860720,
   "end_ms": 861720,
   "text": "There we are"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 861720,
   "end_ms": 862720,
   "text": "You can do that"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 862720,
   "end_ms": 864720,
   "text": "Pinch in to zoom out"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 864720,
   "end_ms": 867720,
   "text": "Oh, you weren't kidding, you were being hunted"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 867720,
   "end_ms": 870720,
   "text": "Oh, can we see what happened to that girl?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 870720,
   "end_ms": 873720,
   "text": "Yeah, I'll pinch out to zoom in"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 878720,
   "end_ms": 880720,
   "text": "I'm powered"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 880720,
   "end_ms": 882720,
   "text": "He ran away"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 887720,
   "end_ms": 888720,
   "text": "Loser"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 888720,
   "end_ms": 891720,
   "text": "She saved you and she's hot"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 891720,
   "end_ms": 892720,
   "text": "Yeah, I know"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 892720,
   "end_ms": 893720,
   "text": "I'm a coward"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 893720,
   "end_ms": 894720,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 896720,
   "end_ms": 898720,
   "text": "My auction"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 903720,
   "end_ms": 904720,
   "text": "I'm dead"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 904720,
   "end_ms": 906720,
   "text": "Wait, how much is delivery?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 914720,
   "end_ms": 916720,
   "text": "My god, 2,000"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 916720,
   "end_ms": 919720,
   "text": "Their address is on some remote island"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 921720,
   "end_ms": 925720,
   "text": "There's no fee if you meet them to get the phone in person"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 947720,
   "end_ms": 948720,
   "text": "I'll be back"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 952720,
   "end_ms": 953720,
   "text": "Oh"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 956720,
   "end_ms": 958720,
   "text": "I'm home"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 962720,
   "end_ms": 963720,
   "text": "Question"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 966720,
   "end_ms": 968720,
   "text": "Could you pick up these headphones for me?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 968720,
   "end_ms": 970720,
   "text": "Where are they?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 970720,
   "end_ms": 971720,
   "text": "Kumamoto"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 971720,
   "end_ms": 973720,
   "text": "Five minutes"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 975720,
   "end_ms": 976720,
   "text": "And this sofa?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 976720,
   "end_ms": 978720,
   "text": "That looks really heavy"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 978720,
   "end_ms": 980720,
   "text": "I will give you a shorter massage"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 980720,
   "end_ms": 982720,
   "text": "Oh, okay"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 982720,
   "end_ms": 986720,
   "text": "That's how Uncle learned to bid online without paying shipping fees"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 989720,
   "end_ms": 990720,
   "text": "Thanks"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 991720,
   "end_ms": 994720,
   "text": "I would have gone to pick that up for you"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 994720,
   "end_ms": 996720,
   "text": "It was free, I have Amazon Prime"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 996720,
   "end_ms": 998720,
   "text": "Is there a box cutter?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1000720,
   "end_ms": 1001720,
   "text": "Here"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1001720,
   "end_ms": 1002720,
   "text": "Thank you"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1005720,
   "end_ms": 1006720,
   "text": "Where did this come from?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1006720,
   "end_ms": 1008720,
   "text": "A storage spell"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1008720,
   "end_ms": 1011720,
   "text": "By the way, that thing can kill dragons, so be careful"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1011720,
   "end_ms": 1013720,
   "text": "That's so cool"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1013720,
   "end_ms": 1016720,
   "text": "Did you bring anything else back with you?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1016720,
   "end_ms": 1018720,
   "text": "I don't know why"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1019720,
   "end_ms": 1021720,
   "text": "Like a magic sword"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1023720,
   "end_ms": 1024720,
   "text": "Why do you pause it?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1024720,
   "end_ms": 1026720,
   "text": "I also have precious metals"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1026720,
   "end_ms": 1027720,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1027720,
   "end_ms": 1031720,
   "text": "The stone is a mermaid tear crystallized by magic"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1031720,
   "end_ms": 1033720,
   "text": "And the band was carved from rainbow coral"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1033720,
   "end_ms": 1036720,
   "text": "In the other world, you could buy a castle with this"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1036720,
   "end_ms": 1037720,
   "text": "Sell them, sell them all!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1038720,
   "end_ms": 1040720,
   "text": "50 yen"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1041720,
   "end_ms": 1043720,
   "text": "I took them to a pawn shop"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1043720,
   "end_ms": 1045720,
   "text": "And they told me 50 yen"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1045720,
   "end_ms": 1046720,
   "text": "It's too rare"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1048720,
   "end_ms": 1051720,
   "text": "We're not getting as many views as I thought"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1051720,
   "end_ms": 1053720,
   "text": "I need a new idea"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1053720,
   "end_ms": 1056720,
   "text": "Uncle, so I'm guessing you had this"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1056720,
   "end_ms": 1059720,
   "text": "Because you were going to give it to someone?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1059720,
   "end_ms": 1060720,
   "text": "No"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1060720,
   "end_ms": 1062720,
   "text": "It's just a commemorative trophy"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1062720,
   "end_ms": 1066720,
   "text": "You have to beat a pretty hard dungeon to get one of them, though"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1066720,
   "end_ms": 1067720,
   "text": "I see"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1069720,
   "end_ms": 1071720,
   "text": "You want to talk about love?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1071720,
   "end_ms": 1072720,
   "text": "No"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1072720,
   "end_ms": 1075720,
   "text": "I doubt you ever had a romance in the other world"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1075720,
   "end_ms": 1076720,
   "text": "No thanks"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1076720,
   "end_ms": 1077720,
   "text": "Yes, I did"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1077720,
   "end_ms": 1079720,
   "text": "But I've been alive over 30 years"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1079720,
   "end_ms": 1081720,
   "text": "I've gotten plenty of action"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1083720,
   "end_ms": 1086720,
   "text": "My first love was in elementary school"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1086720,
   "end_ms": 1087720,
   "text": "Who was she?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1087720,
   "end_ms": 1089720,
   "text": "Sonic and Tails"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1089720,
   "end_ms": 1090720,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1091720,
   "end_ms": 1093720,
   "text": "I don't know"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1093720,
   "end_ms": 1095720,
   "text": "I don't know"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1095720,
   "end_ms": 1097720,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1105720,
   "end_ms": 1108720,
   "text": "I'd go to the toy store every afternoon"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1108720,
   "end_ms": 1110720,
   "text": "To watch the video demo play"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1112720,
   "end_ms": 1114720,
   "text": "That title screen was so cute"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1114720,
   "end_ms": 1116720,
   "text": "I never got tired of it"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1116720,
   "end_ms": 1119720,
   "text": "Do you have people stories?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1119720,
   "end_ms": 1120720,
   "text": "Oh yeah"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1121720,
   "end_ms": 1124720,
   "text": "There was this girl named Kaibinanase"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1125720,
   "end_ms": 1127720,
   "text": "She was killed by water"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1127720,
   "end_ms": 1130720,
   "text": "Then her brain was transferred into an evil cyborg body"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1130720,
   "end_ms": 1133720,
   "text": "She attacked me after I hunted down the Seven Force"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1133720,
   "end_ms": 1135720,
   "text": "She's the boss of level three"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1135720,
   "end_ms": 1136720,
   "text": "And takes on five"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1136720,
   "end_ms": 1139720,
   "text": "This man had no life outside of games"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1140720,
   "end_ms": 1142720,
   "text": "Were there any nice girls in the other world?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1142720,
   "end_ms": 1143720,
   "text": "No"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1143720,
   "end_ms": 1144720,
   "text": "Sure"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1144720,
   "end_ms": 1145720,
   "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1146720,
   "end_ms": 1147720,
   "text": "Icarus"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1147720,
   "end_ms": 1148720,
   "text": "I'll run"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1155720,
   "end_ms": 1156720,
   "text": "Icarus"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1169720,
   "end_ms": 1171720,
   "text": "Thank you very much"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1185720,
   "end_ms": 1187720,
   "text": "I"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1201720,
   "end_ms": 1204720,
   "text": "I managed to save her from that awful monster"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1205720,
   "end_ms": 1209720,
   "text": "Looks more like she's sacrificing herself to protect her brothers"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1209720,
   "end_ms": 1211720,
   "text": "Pretty cool, right?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1211720,
   "end_ms": 1213720,
   "text": "I think we got ambushed by goblins"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1213720,
   "end_ms": 1215720,
   "text": "Or something soon after this"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1215720,
   "end_ms": 1217720,
   "text": "Well, I fell off a cliff"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1217720,
   "end_ms": 1218720,
   "text": "Never saw her again"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1218720,
   "end_ms": 1220720,
   "text": "That must have been terrible"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1222720,
   "end_ms": 1223720,
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1223720,
   "end_ms": 1227720,
   "text": "Those kids are looking a little suspicious back there"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1227720,
   "end_ms": 1229720,
   "text": "I should look at what attacked me"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1229720,
   "end_ms": 1231720,
   "text": "I'm sure it was a goblin"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1231720,
   "end_ms": 1232720,
   "text": "Yeah?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1232720,
   "end_ms": 1234720,
   "text": "Oh yeah, definitely"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1235720,
   "end_ms": 1237720,
   "text": "Whatever it was almost killed me"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1237720,
   "end_ms": 1239720,
   "text": "And that awful woman showed up"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1239720,
   "end_ms": 1240720,
   "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1240720,
   "end_ms": 1242720,
   "text": "I hate to admit it, but she saved me"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1243720,
   "end_ms": 1245720,
   "text": "I"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1253720,
   "end_ms": 1255720,
   "text": "But why?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1255720,
   "end_ms": 1257720,
   "text": "Why save me?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1257720,
   "end_ms": 1259720,
   "text": "I did you a favor"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1259720,
   "end_ms": 1260720,
   "text": "You're in my debt"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1260720,
   "end_ms": 1263720,
   "text": "Now you'll spend the rest of your life trying to repay me"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1265720,
   "end_ms": 1267720,
   "text": "The rest of my life"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1268720,
   "end_ms": 1269720,
   "text": "I"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1269720,
   "end_ms": 1270720,
   "text": "I"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1270720,
   "end_ms": 1272720,
   "text": "I didn't mean it like that"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1272720,
   "end_ms": 1274720,
   "text": "It's not like we're going to be together forever"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1277720,
   "end_ms": 1278720,
   "text": "Stop it"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1278720,
   "end_ms": 1279720,
   "text": "Stay right there"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1279720,
   "end_ms": 1281720,
   "text": "I don't have much to pay you in"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1281720,
   "end_ms": 1283720,
   "text": "What about this?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1287720,
   "end_ms": 1288720,
   "text": "It's a cosmic ring"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1288720,
   "end_ms": 1290720,
   "text": "One of only seven in the whole world"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1291720,
   "end_ms": 1292720,
   "text": "Hey, stop"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1292720,
   "end_ms": 1293720,
   "text": "What are you doing?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1298720,
   "end_ms": 1300720,
   "text": "It should fit"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1301720,
   "end_ms": 1302720,
   "text": "Wait a second"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1303720,
   "end_ms": 1305720,
   "text": "This is too fast"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1305720,
   "end_ms": 1306720,
   "text": "You don't want it"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1306720,
   "end_ms": 1307720,
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1313720,
   "end_ms": 1314720,
   "text": "I do"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1320720,
   "end_ms": 1322720,
   "text": "Did he just propose to her?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1323720,
   "end_ms": 1324720,
   "text": "Is that allowed?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1324720,
   "end_ms": 1325720,
   "text": "From her reaction"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1325720,
   "end_ms": 1329720,
   "text": "It looks like they have the same marriage customs as us in the other world"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1329720,
   "end_ms": 1331720,
   "text": "At least it seems so"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1331720,
   "end_ms": 1332720,
   "text": "Of course I did"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1334720,
   "end_ms": 1338720,
   "text": "I even got the ring appraised for her in the next town"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1338720,
   "end_ms": 1340720,
   "text": "Oh come on, Uncle"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1345720,
   "end_ms": 1349720,
   "text": "Oh no, is this the town you said you managed to lose her in?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1349720,
   "end_ms": 1351720,
   "text": "No, she hung around after this"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1351720,
   "end_ms": 1354720,
   "text": "You know, I think she wanted my money"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1354720,
   "end_ms": 1356720,
   "text": "I put it all in the bank"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1356720,
   "end_ms": 1358720,
   "text": "Where are you going next, Tom?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1358720,
   "end_ms": 1359720,
   "text": "You're resting here?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1359720,
   "end_ms": 1361720,
   "text": "What a coincidence, so am I"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1361720,
   "end_ms": 1363720,
   "text": "She's persistent"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1364720,
   "end_ms": 1369720,
